  <item>
    <title>Jim Nantz shares the &quot;hello friends&quot; origin story</title>
    <link>https://www.youtube.com/shorts/ucfmjPclX9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.youtube.com/shorts/ucfmjPclX9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Feb 2026 17:27:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>Skratch</dc:creator>
    <description>&lt;p&gt;When Jim Nantz welcomed viewers with “hello friends” for the very first time, he didn’t plan on it becoming his catchphrase. He shares the heartfelt origin story, and why it still has so much meaning today.

